# Exceptions to the release image scan (.github/workflows/release.yml).
# Each entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:YYYY-MM-DD). After the expiry
# date Trivy fails on it again, so the exception cannot be forgotten.

# CVE-2026-84782: libssl3 3.0.20-1~deb12u2 in the distroless/cc-debian12 base
# image (OpenSSL information disclosure via DTLS handshake retransmission).
# Debian fixed it in 3.0.22-1~deb12u2, but on 2026-11-11 the latest distroless
# image still shipped the old package, so there was nothing to upgrade to.
# The server does not use OpenSSL: HTTPS goes through rustls and Cargo.lock has
# no openssl crates; it never opens DTLS connections.
# Remove this entry when distroless ships the fixed libssl3.
CVE-2026-84782 exp:2026-12-11
